WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Stop pretending here

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,080
The ten taels of silver your family owes me is due

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,560
Your father was seriously ill back then

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,680
What I lent to your family was life-saving money.

5
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,040
Nine out and thirteen back

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,120
Add up principal and interest

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,560
If you can't get the money today

8
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,680
Your ancestral home will belong to me.

9
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,800
Did you hear me?

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,240
Hand over the property deed quickly

11
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,040
Otherwise, don't blame grandpa for being rude. Shopkeeper Qian, you can't do this.

12
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,600
The bones of Makikawa’s parents are still cold

13
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,360
Just come to the child's ancestral home, old man

14
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:29,540
Do you have the right to interrupt here? Uncle Zhou Xuan, I have my own sense of humor.

15
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:30,820
I can give you the house deed

16
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:34,380
Don't you go to the county government office to sue me for loaning money to your house?

17
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,140
I can give you the title deed to the entire yard.

18
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,540
But you have to take one thing in exchange

19
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,540
Don't think about the lion opening his mouth

20
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,180
Your shabby house is leaking air everywhere

21
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:44,780
That piece of land isn't worth much. What do you want?
